title: "NeuroVision-X: a reproducible 3D glioma MRI segmentation research stack"
message: Cite this GitHub repository as software. It is not a peer-reviewed article.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "NeuroVision-X contributors"
url: "https://github.com/Shaiza666/neurovision-x"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Shaiza666/neurovision-x"
license: MIT
version: "0.9.0"
date-released: "2026-11-17"
abstract: >-
  Experimental research prototype for 3D glioma segmentation on multimodal MRI.
  Not a clinically validated diagnostic system. Official BraTS training has not
  been run in this repository; challenge Dice/HD95/ECE are not measured.
keywords:
  - medical image segmentation
  - glioma
  - MRI
  - uncertainty
  - reproducibility
